ebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f75e1125f61f318\" href=\"?note=4f75e1125f61f318\" title=\"56-df-sigma-homomorphism\">56-df-sigma-homomorphism</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^V\">\\(\\beta\\in A^V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span>；项解释见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b729ff69dbfa830d\" href=\"?note=b729ff69dbfa830d\" title=\"56-df-satisfaction\">56-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\beta\\coloneqq\\{(x,h(\\beta(x))):x\\in V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\beta\\coloneqq\\{(x,h(\\beta(x))):x\\in V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h\\beta\\in B^V\\land h(t^{(A,I)}[\\beta])=t^{(B,J)}[h\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h\\beta\\in B^V\\land h(t^{(A,I)}[\\beta])=t^{(B,J)}[h\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Definitions 2.5.1、7.2.1(i) 的本地推论，不冒称原书独立编号命题。对t结构归纳：变量分支为h(β(x))；函数分支先用同态方程，再逐个用子项归纳假设。空参数情形正是常元保持。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，2.5.1; 7.2.1(i)，印刷页 43–44; 266。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","t